0.8032.M.25.12.16 fork 2025-12-16
    - Production fork based on the 0.8032 codebase — a divergent branch, not a mainline
      release. It drops the whole Compuset/C7 subsystem and the tracking API, and adds ECM
      (Alfresco), REST emailing, Keycloak authentication, IBAN/BIC validation, QR codes and
      LaTeX index handling. The version string is not a valid CPAN version (kept as-is for
      traceability).
    - New modules: oEdtk::Utils (date/price parsing, tracking helpers, index formatting, string
      cleaning), oEdtk::FixIdx (even page counts in .idx files), oEdtk::LaTeX (latin-9 escaping,
      \gdef tags, index generation), oEdtk::Emailing (REST email via the nws_emailing service,
      requires Perl 5.028), oEdtk::Keycloak (OAuth2 client_credentials token, requires Perl
      5.020), oEdtk::Infinite (COBOL Infinite flow parsing), oEdtk::IBAN (IBAN/BIC validation),
      oEdtk::Constants (ECM document typology), oEdtk::Restitution (path-based value extraction),
      oEdtk::DisseminationPlan (REST dissemination plan), oEdtk::XML::DTD / oEdtk::XML::XSD /
      oEdtk::XML::DTD::Utils (XML validation against DTD/XSD).
    - oEdtk::Main: oe_ID_LDOC now generates a Data::UUID string instead of the numeric
      YWWWDHHMMSSPPPP.r format; new job-handling subs (oe_options, oe_params, oe_simple_job,
      oe_new_job_input_file, oe_new_job_output_file, oe_print_to_output_file,
      oe_get_handle_to_input_file, oe_typ_prod, oe_watermark, oe_backgrounds_apps,
      oe_config_compo, oe_clean_addr, oe_new_ID_LDOC); all Compuset/C7 functions removed
      (c7Flux, toC7date, fmt_address, fmt_address_sender, fmt_monetary, date2time,
      oe_CAP_sans_accents, oe_cdata_table_build, oe_close_fo, oe_compo_set_value,
      oe_csv2data_handles, oe_define_Compuset_output, oe_env_var_completion, oe_fmt_date,
      oe_outmngr_compo_run, oe_outmngr_full_run, oe_outmngr_output_run, oe_round, recEdtk_*,
      prodEdtk_*, oe_rec_output, oe_unique_data_name).
    - oEdtk::Run: new oe_background_pdf, update_idx, listing_depository (bpdf backgrounds via
      PDF::Tk + EDMS_BIN_PDFTK); oe_outmngr_output_run_tex handles recto-verso filières with
      make_docs_even_numbered and writes LOTPDF.txt in UTF-8; oe_after_compo honors
      EDTK_KEEP_OUT_FILE, supports the bpdf option, keeps the index file and checks the PDF
      exists; oe_status_to_msg returns '(status is zero)' for status 0.
    - oEdtk::EDMS: rewritten for Perl 5.20+ (signatures, IPC::Run3); 36-column index CSV with
      optional Alfresco header (EDMS_ACTIVATE_HEADER_ALFRESCO / EDMS_IDX_HEADER); new subs
      _log, my_system, preprend_alfresco_header_if_needed, EDMS_merge_docs; EDMS_import returns 0.
    - oEdtk::DBAdmin: new acquit processing (_acquit_API via oEUser::ECM, _acquit_table_INDEX,
      create_table_ACQMGENTECH, get_columns_names); csv_import does acquit processing + email
      report (EDTK_MAIL_ACQ) + uppercasing + ref_col; copy_table adds Oracle hints
      (PARALLEL 4 COMPRESS NOLOGGING PCTFREE 0); @INDEX_COLS gains 4 ECM columns; removed
      create_table_PARA, create_table_DATAGROUPS, _drop_table_TRACKING.
    - oEdtk::Config: use utf8; new read_hash sub; tie with -fallback => 'DEFAULT'; the hostname
      section is no longer merged last (mainline behavior).
    - oEdtk::RecordParser: denormalized handling split into set_denormalized_option_record /
      set_denormalized_on_record; byte cleaning via oEdtk::Utils::kill_non_latin_1_9_chars_in_place.
    - oEdtk::TexDoc: new append_qr_code, hhline_content, is_in_list (QR codes via Text::QRCode).
    - oEdtk::trackEdtk: tracking API removed (init_Tracking, track_Obj, define_Mod_Ed,
      define_Job_Evt, define_Job_User, define_Track_Key, open_Tracking_Env, test_exist_table,
      create_Track_Table, drop_Track_Table).
    - oEdtk::libDev: removed delSp, IdUniqueSur6, IdUniqueSur7, lastLong; run_Edtk_dev is
      LaTeX-only (no Compuset branch); bug fix in tree_Directory_Completion (numeric comparison).
    - oEdtk::libXls: removed prod_Xls_Add_Sheet. oEdtk::Spool: removed emit. oEdtk::Record:
      bind() semantics changed; bind_all/bind_all_c7 removed. oEdtk::Doc: $LINE_CUTOFF = 1
      (one TeX command per line).
    - New scripts lib/db_move.pl, lib/edms_runner.pl; acq_Load.pl removed.
    - New tests t/IBAN.pm.t, t/Utils.pm.t, t/FixIdx.pm.t.
    - cpanfile rewritten (replaces the Makefile.PL PREREQ_PM list); new dependencies Text::CSV_XS,
      XML::Simple, XML::Parser, XML::Encoding, Mail::Sender, Barcode::DataMatrix, PDF::API2,
      Hash::Merge::Simple, Hash::Flatten, MIME::Lite, Email::Valid, YAML::Tiny, Text::QRCode,
      Regexp::Common, PDF::Tk, Locale::PO, XML::LibXSLT, Text::Unaccent::PurePerl.
    - iniEdtk/edtk.ini added (mainline only ships tplate.edtk.ini): new [ENVDESC] keys
      (EDTK_XML_CATALOG_FILES, EDTK_DIR_FORMS, EDTK_DIR_BACKGROUNDS, ...), enriched [MAIL]
      section, [COMPO] lualatex switch (EDTK_COMPO_ASYNC), [EDOCMNGR] Alfresco keys,
      [EDTK_DB] and [EDTK_STATS] sections.

